<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador bank liquidity up 0.97 pct in September.</title>
<headline>Ecuador bank liquidity up 0.97 pct in September.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's Central Bank said Monday liquidity in the bank system grew 0.97 percent, or 148 million sucres, to 15.35 billion sucres in September.</p>
<p>At the end of August, bank liquidity stood at 15.20 billion sucres.</p>
<p>Total liquidity in the bank sector ended 1995 at 12.51 billion sucres, up 41.2 percent from 1994.</p>
<p>-- Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433</p>
</text>
